[6989]="700356A8\n1\tTalk to Ránmald\tYou should speak with Ránmald.\n2\tAsk Céolflad why she is cold to Ránmald\tYou should speak with Céolflad.\n3\tAsk Edhild why the women do not like Ránmald\tYou should speak with Edhild.\n4\tAsk Frithwyn why she does not like Ránmald\tYou should speak with Frithwyn.\n5\tRoar at the unkind women\tYou should express your frustration and roar at the women. NOTE: This objective requires an emote.\n6\tAsk Ránmald if she will excuse you while you talk to the others\tYou should speak with Ránmald.\n7\tMeet the women of Byre Tor at Aldstan's grave\tThe women of Byre Tor can be found at Aldstan's grave. You should speak with the women.\n8\tSpeak with Edhild\tYou should speak with Edhild at Aldstan's grave.\n9\tListen to Céolflad's speech\tListen to Céolflad's speech.\n10\tTalk to Céolflad\tTalk to Céolflad.\n11\tTalk to Frithwyn at Céolstan's grave\tTalk to Frithwyn at Céolstan's grave.\n12\tListen to Frithwyn\tListen to Frithwyn.\n13\tTalk to Edhild at Céolstan's grave\tTalk to Edhild at Céolstan's grave.\n14\tSee if Edhild needs comfort\tTalk to Edhild again.\n",
[6990]="700000C8\n1\tLeave your cell and approach your rescuer (Use W to move forward)\tYou awake in a holding pen in a brigand camp. A grim-looking man -- a Ranger, Strider -- is standing before you. As you groggily stand up, his urgent voice reaches your ears.\n2\tSearch the satchel for weapons (Right-click the satchel to loot it)\tA satchel is on the floor near your rescuer. Strider told you to search the satchel for any weapons and collect its contents, for you will need to defend yourself during this daring escape.\n3\tSpeak with Strider (Right-click Strider to talk)\tStrider has bested the brigand guards, but he warns there are more enemies ahead. The Ranger wants you to practice combat by sparring with him to ensure that you are able to protect yourself during the escape.\n4\tSpeak with Strider\tNow that you have practiced combat, speak with Strider and find out what to do next.\n5\tFollow Strider outside\tStrider has left the jailhouse and entered the yard. He is waiting for you there.\n6\tSpeak with Strider\tNow that you have left the jailhouse, speak with Stider and find out where to go next.\n7\tDefeat Celandine's captors (total: 4)\tCelandine Brandybuck is being held ahead in the brigand camp. Strider wishes you to rescue the hobbits, starting with Celandine, while he goes off in search of signs of Mordor (whose presence is startlingly near.) You will need to defeat any brigands you come upon while searching for the hobbits.\n8\tTalk to Celandine Brandybuck\tCelandine is being held in a cage against the wall of the enclosure. You have defeated Celandine's captors, but you have not found Mundo Sackville-Baggins. Celandine may be able to tell you where Mundo is being held.\n9\tDefeat Mundo's captor\tMundo Sackville-Baggins is being held in the yard beyond the gate of Celandine's holding pen. Celandine's distraction was a success. Only one brigand remains behind to guard Mundo. You should get rid of him quickly.\n10\tSpeak with Mundo Sackville-Baggins\tMundo is tied to a post in the yard. Despite the defeat of his captor, Mundo Sackville-Baggins appears particularly displeased. You should encourage him to join you.\n11\tFind Strider and Amdir\tStrider and Amdir await you and the hobbits at the main gate. You have freed both of the missing hobbits, but you have not yet escaped the camp.\n12\tTalk to Amdir\tAmdir lies just beyond the main gate. The Ranger Amdir was struck down by the Black Rider before Strider could drive him off. You should ask Strider what to do, for the situation is now dire.\n13\tTalk to Strider\tStrider waits near the main gate. Amdir is gravely wounded. Strider will best know what to do to help his friend.\n14\tTalk to Strider\tStrider waits near the main gate. Amdir is gravely wounded. Strider will best know what to do to help his friend.\n",
[6991]="7004729D\n1\tTalk to Malthengil\tMalthengil has asked you to deliver your report of Mordor to King Elessar, but first there are some matters on which the king must rule.\n2\tWait until the king calls for your report\tKing Elessar must weigh the issues facing Gondor and make his pronouncements.\n3\tFind Beregond in the Hall of the King and tell him it is his time for judgement\tBeregond is in the hall, and has not heard that it is his time for judgement.\n4\tWait until the king calls for your report\tKing Elessar must weigh the issues facing Gondor and make his pronouncements.\n",
[6992]="700544A5\n1\tTalk to Dolenthol\tTalk to Dolenthol.\n2\tKeep close to Dolenthol and remain alert\tKeep close to Dolenthol and remain alert. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tDefeat Thargaun\030Defeat the Morroval\tDefeat Thargaun and the Morroval. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[6993]="700649B7\n1\tTalk to the Castamir supporter inside the abandoned home\tA supporter of Castamir stands inside an abandoned home and bars your passage.\n2\tFind Maethon somewhere within the abandoned homes of Linhir\tMaethon is somewhere within the abandoned homes taken over by supporters of the Heirs of Castamir.\n3\tTalk to Maethon\tMaethon is within one of the abandoned homes of Linhir now used by supporters of the Heirs of Castamir.\n4\tMaethon asked you to introduce yourself to some of the supporters of Castamir in the cellar of the abandoned home.\t\n5\tTalk to Maethon\tMaethon is in the cellar of an abandoned home in Linhir.\n6\tObserve the meeting of the Castamir supporters\tSupporters of the Heirs of Castamir secretly meet in a cellar in Linhir.\n7\tTalk to Tumúldo Fierce-water\tTumúldo Fierce-water, emissary from Umbar, is interested to speak with you.\n8\tObserve the meeting of the Castamir supporters and the emissaries from Umbar\tSupporters of the Heirs of Castamir secretly meet in a cellar in Linhir.\n9\tTalk to Maethon\tMaethon is in the cellar of an abandoned home in Linhir.\n10\tObserve the meeting of the Castamir supporters and the emissaries from Umbar\tSupporters of the Heirs of Castamir secretly meet in a cellar in Linhir.\n11\tTalk to Maethon\tMaethon is in the cellar of an abandoned home in Linhir.\n12\tFollow Maethon upstairs and learn what has happened\tSomething has happened upstairs!\n13\tExamine Tumúldo Fierce-water\tTumúldo Fierce-water has been grievously wounded, a deadly blade buried in his back.\n14\tHear what transpired\tTumúldo Fierce-water lies dying, attacked by the supporters of Castamir.\n15\tTalk to Nakási\tNakási Wave-reaper desires vengeance upon the Heirs of Castamir, and has challenged you to stand with her against them.\n16\tHear the final words of Tumúldo Fierce-water\tTumúldo Fierce-water is on the very precipice of death.\n",
[6994]="70038209\n1\tSpeak with Éowyn\tÉowyn stands in Meduseld as she presides over Edoras in King Théoden's absence. You should speak with Éowyn.\n2\tListen to Éowyn\tÉowyn stands in Meduseld as she presides over Edoras in King Théoden's absence. You should listen to Éowyn.\n3\tListen to Éowyn\tÉowyn stands in Meduseld as she presides over Edoras in King Théoden's absence. You should listen to Éowyn.\n4\tSpeak with Éowyn\tÉowyn stands in Meduseld as she presides over Edoras in King Théoden's absence. You should speak with Éowyn.\n5\tSpeak with Witwyn, the serving-woman\tWitwyn, Éowyn's serving-woman, can be found in Meduseld. Witwyn wishes to speak with you.\n",
[6995]="7000D5B9\n1\tFind Laerdan\tEnter Sammath Baul and find Laerdan.\n",
[6996]="70067CB8\n1\tTalk to Cruel Dancer in the hidden harbour\tCruel Dancer has come with you to the hidden harbour.\n2\tBoard the nearest ship to the west in the hidden harbour\tThe nearest of the ships you should investigate is to the west.\n3\tWait for Cruel Dancer to join you aboard the ship\tYou have boarded the first ship and should wait for Cruel Dancer to join you.\n4\tTalk to Cruel Dancer aboard the ship\tCruel Dancer stands aboard the deck of one of the ships moored within the hidden harbour.\n5\tDefeat the Corsair defenders aboard the ship while Cruel Dancer searches below deck\tCorsairs loyal to the Kindred of the Coins have learned of your presence in the hidden harbour!\n6\tTalk to Cruel Dancer aboard the first ship in the hidden harbour\tCruel Dancer has returned from her search of the first ship's interior.\n7\tFollow the walkways to the second ship moored within the hidden harbour\tHaving found no one within the first ship, Cruel Dancer believes the hostages you seek may be aboard the second ship moored within the hidden harbour.\n8\tTalk to Corudan aboard the second ship moored within the hidden harbour\tCorudan is a captive aboard the second ship, but he is still alive.\n9\tWait for the ship's captain to arrive\tWait for the captain of the ship to arrive.\n10\tTalk to Tatháta the Beast aboard her ship\tTatháta the Beast stands upon the deck of her ship.\n11\tWitness the confrontation between Cruel Dancer and Tatháta the Beast\tCruel Dancer engages Tatháta the Beast in conversation aboard the second ship moored within the hidden harbour.\n12\tDefeat Tatháta and her crew\tThe conversation has become a violent conflict!\n13\tTalk to Corudan aboard the second ship moored within the hidden harbour\tCruel Dancer has chased after Tatháta the Beast, but your priority must be to rescue Corudan.\n",
[6997]="70064F75\n1\tTalk to Caebar in Lond Cirion\tCaebar is in the study of Lond Cirion, where Golasgil's testament will be read.\n2\tListen to the reading of Golasgil's final wishes\tKing Elessar has commanded that Lord Golasgil's testament be read aloud and his wishes carried out.\n3\tExamine the papers that contain Golasgil's final wishes\tLady Marra has produced her husband's final wishes and set them on the table.\n4\tStand ready in the event you will be of some use\tKing Elessar has suggested that his scribe Caebar may be able to ascertain the provenance of the handwriting contained in Golasgil's purported testament.\n5\tThe study of Lond Cirion may contain samples of Lord Golasgil's writing that can be used to prove he wrote the testament, and its provenance made secure.\t\n6\tGive Golasgil's notes on the currents to Caebar\tCaebar is in the study of Lond Cirion, seeking to prove that Golasgil's testament was truly written by the Lord of Anfalas before his death in battle.\n7\tListen to the reading of Golasgil's final wishes\tYou and Caebar have proven that both the testament and Golasgil's notes on the currents were written by the same person, and now the Lord of Anfalas's last wishes can be read aloud and carried out.\n8\tTalk to King Elessar\tKing Elessar is in the study of Lond Cirion.\n",
[6998]="7003E68E\n1\tTalk to Glorfindel\tYou should speak with Glorfindel before proceeding against the enemy. Glorfindel is standing outside Ost Brandras and waiting for your aid in confronting Ferndúr the Virulent.\n2\tFollow Glorfindel into Ost Brandras\tGlorfindel is at Ost Brandras. You should follow Glorfindel into the ruins and confront Ferndúr the Virulent.\n3\tFight your way to the altar with Glorfindel\tGlorfindel is at Ost Brandras. You should follow Glorfindel into the ruins and confront Ferndúr the Virulent.\n4\tTalk to Glorfindel\tGlorfindel is standing at the base of the altar in Ost Brandras. You have fought your way through many fell spirits and should now confront Ferndúr when you are able.\n5\tApproach the gaunt-men atop the altar\tThe gaunt-men can be found atop the altar in Ost Brandras. You have reached the base of the altar, and should now confront the gaunt-men.\n6\tDefeat Ferndúr the Virulent and his gaunt-men\tFerndúr the Virulent can be found atop the altar in Ost Brandras. You have confronted Ferndúr and should now defeat him.\n",
[6999]="70015E43\n1\tFind the leader of the wood-trolls\tDescend into the wood-trolls' lair and defeat their leader.\n2\tDefeat Zagâfum\030Defeat Logon\tDefeat Zagâfum and Logon.\n",
[7000]="70041A47\n1\tSearch for Nimithil among the crowd\tNimithil can be found somewhere in the Hall of Ost Anglebed. You have travelled to the hall with Nimithil, but became separated amid a large crowd of belligerent people. You should reunite with Nimithil.\n2\tTalk to Nimithil\tNimithil is standing in the rear of the Hall of Ost Anglebed. You have found Nimithil, but the Steward has not yet returned to the Hall. You should ask Nimithil what is to be done.\n3\tListen to Nimithil speak to the crowd of Gondorians\tNimithil is standing in the rear of the Hall of Ost Anglebed. Nimithil is concerned that the arguing in the hall will soon turn to violence and asks for your support in calming the crowd.\n4\tObserve the meeting between Nimithil and Malthellim\tNimithil and Malthellim are speaking near the fire-pit in the centre of the Hall of Ost Anglebed. Nimithil is sharing what you have learned in Lornost and Ost Anglebed with Malthellim. You should listen as they speak.\n5\tDefeat Yamanim, Hosdam, and Khutâ\tYamanim, Hosdam, and Khutâ are moving against the dissenters within the Hall of Ost Anglebed. Malthellim has aligned himself with the Heirs of Castamir and has now allowed the Corsair and Haradrim men in Ost Anglebed to execute dissenting folk.\n6\tSubdue Steward Malthellim\tSteward Malthellim can be found in the Hall of Ost Anglebed. Malthellim has drawn his weapon in desperation, and must now be subdued if the people of Ost Anglebed are to remain safe.\n7\tTalk to Nimithil\tNimithil can be found in the rear of the Hall of Ost Anglebed. You have subdued Steward Malthellim with the aid of Nimithil's guards, and should now speak to Nimithil.\n",
[7001]="7003ADB8\n1\tAsk the boss when the battle will be done\tThe Uruk-commander stands near the ugly gate up ahead. You should ask the boss when the battle will be over, for you grow bored without a drop of blood to stain your sword.\n2\tGet back in line and talk to your neighbour\tYour place in line is back a ways, near some other Orcs. You should get back in line.\n3\tWatch and wait\tYour place in line is back a ways, near some other Orcs. You should watch and wait.\n4\tTalk to your neighbour again\tYour place in line is back a ways, near some other Orcs. You should speak with your neighbour.\n5\tWatch and wait\tYour place in line is back a ways, near some other Orcs. You should watch and wait.\n6\tTry to escape south\tYou must try to escape! Run south, towards Helm's Deep.\n7\tTry to escape towards the north-west\tYou must try to escape! Run north-west, towards the Fords of Isen.\n8\tTry to escape towards the east\tYou must try to escape! Run east, along the dike.\n9\tRun north!\tYou must try to escape! Run north...into the strange trees.\n10\tFind a spot to rest, and rest briefly at the edge of the trees\tFind a resting spot at the edge of the trees.\n11\tEscape through the forest!\tTry to survive!\n",
[7002]="700253DB\n1\tSearch Lhaid Ogo for the lost Dunlending messenger\tThe muddy depths of Lhaid Ogo are home to many decaying horrors, and a Dunlending messenger may be lost within.\n2\tTalk to Anirin in Lhaid Ogo\tYou have found Anirin in the depths of Lhaid Ogo and should speak with him.\n",
[7003]="7003971A\n1\tSpeak with Calin\tSpeak to Calin before joining the confrontation. It appears Gifemund and Thurferth are in an argument that could get violent near the empty throne.\n2\tObserve the discussion\tThere is a heated discussion between Gifemund and Thurferth in front of the empty throne in the mead hall.\n3\tObserve Calin and Gifemund's discussion\tNow that Thurferth has left, Gifemund and Calin have engaged in a quieter discussion.\n4\tSpeak with Calin\tSpeak to Calin near the throne at the back of the mead hall.\n",
[7004]="7002C00E\n1\tTalk to Céola\tCéola is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands. You should speak at once with Céola to learn his plan.\n2\tDefeat all of the attacking Khundolar\tDefeat all of the attacking Khundolar.\n3\tTalk to Céola at Etheburg in the Brown Lands\tCéola is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands. You should speak with Céola regarding the battle at Etheburg.\n",
[7005]="70056FAE\n1\tTalk to Venko at Limlók\tVenko is ready to speak with the Beorning chieftain at the village of Limlók and learn if he has seen the missing raiding-party from Gundabad.\n2\tMeet with Runerik, the village chieftain of Limlók\tVenko wishes to speak with the village chieftain of Limlók to learn what befell the raiding-party from Gundabad.\n3\tExamine the south-eastern fence of Limlók\030Examine the eastern fence of Limlók\030Examine the north-eastern fence of Limlók\030Examine the north-western fence of Limlók\030Examine the south-western fence of Limlók\tRunerik believes his town has nothing to fear from the missing raiding-party, but your companions want to check Limlók's exterior fences just to make sure.\n4\tTalk to Runerik Knotbeard outside his house in Limlók\tRunerik Knotbeard stands outside his home in Limlók.\n5\tFollow Runerik Knotbeard\tRunerik does not believe his village is any more susceptible to danger than is usual for his people.\n6\tFind Imák and protect him from the Orcs\030Find Venko and protect him from the Orcs\tThe raiding-party has attacked the village of Limlók from multiple directions at the same time!\n7\tReturn to Glóin in the village square and protect him from the Orcs\tThe raiding-party has attacked the village of Limlók from multiple directions at the same time!\n8\tListen to Glóin's words\tThe raiding-party that threatened the safety of Limlók has been defeated, thanks to your efforts and those of your companions, as well as those of the people who dwell there. One Orc remains alive, but he will soon die of his wounds.\n9\tTalk to Natsatúg before he dies of his wounds\tThe raiding-party that threatened the safety of Limlók has been defeated, thanks to your efforts and those of your companions, as well as those of the people who dwell there. One Orc remains alive, but he will soon die of his wounds.\n",
[7006]="7006056D\n1\tTalk to Prestadír outside Eitheldir\tPrestadír is outside the ruins of Eitheldir.\n2\tTalk to Prestadír\tPrestadír stands in the ruins of Eitheldir.\n3\tTalk to Prestadír\tPrestadír stands in the ruins of Eitheldir.\n4\tFollow Prestadír through the hole in the wall\tPrestadír has asked for you to follow him outside.\n5\tTalk to Prestadír outside the walls of Eitheldir\tPrestadír stands above the rushing waters of the Hoarwell, just outside the walls of Eitheldir.\n",
[7007]="7004544D\n1\tFind the source of the Dheghûn\030Defeat Dheghûn (total: 10)\tDefeat the Dheghûn and find out where they are coming from within the Nardol mines.\n2\tDestroy the source of the Dheghûn\tDestroy the source of the Dheghûn.\n3\tDefeat Gúthrakh the Ravenous\tDestroy the source of the Dheghûn.\n4\tSpeak with Rhûd-pulo-Drât\tYou should speak with Rhûd-pulo-Drât.\n",
[7008]="700300F5\n1\tTalk to Baillas\tThe old Ent Baillas is in Fangorn.\n2\tSearch east of Baillas for the source of the sound\tThe rustling sound came from the east of Baillas.\n3\tTalk to Baillas\tThe old Ent Baillas is in Fangorn.\n",
